# Existing pages still use local fixtures; no API call is made just by opening them.
# The new REST foundation defaults to the same-origin backend prefix:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
# During Vite development, configure a same-origin API proxy before live integration.
# A different-origin URL alone does not configure CORS/cookies or SSO callbacks.
# Backend deployment settings belong in deployments/.env.
